WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.331
Around the sixth century BCE,

2
00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:04.504
sixteen big states covered north

3
00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.446
India. One of them would

4
00:00:06.446 --> 00:00:08.063
build an empire.

5
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.011
Buddhist texts like the Anguttara

6
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.568
Nikaya list 16 mahajanapadas.

7
00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:15.030
Some ruled by kings,

8
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.798
some by assemblies.

9
00:00:17.153 --> 00:00:19.103
Magadha had iron ore nearby,

10
00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:20.654
and fertile plains.

11
00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:22.283
Elephants from the forests,

12
00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:24.237
and rivers for transport.

13
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.762
The same age saw Buddhism

14
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:28.419
and Jainism.

15
00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:30.003
Your turn.

16
00:00:30.003 --> 00:00:31.453
Which one?
